.Dd October 24, 2026
.Dt WEATHERRC 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm weatherrc
.Nd settings for weather and xweather
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Pa ~/.weatherrc
holds the settings shared by
.Xr weather 1
and
.Xr xweather 1 .
It is a text file of lines of the form
.Pp
.Dl key = value
.Pp
Blank lines are ignored and anything from a
.Ql #
to the end of a line is a comment.
Spaces around keys and values are ignored.
If a key appears more than once the last value wins.
Lines end with LF, CR LF or a lone CR (classic Mac OS); the line number in an error counts all three.
An unknown key, a bad value or a line without an equals sign is an error that names the line number.
A missing file is the same as an empty one.
.Pp
Programs that change the file
.Pf ( Fl S
in
.Xr weather 1 ,
and the Location dialog and Options menu in
.Xr xweather 1 )
rewrite only the keys they own and leave every other line, comment and line ending as it was.
The new file replaces the old one atomically, keeps its permissions, and a symbolic link is followed
rather than replaced.
.Sh KEYS
.Bl -tag -width "autorefresh"
.It Ic latitude
Decimal degrees, \-90 to 90, up to four decimals.
Default 43.0747 (Madison, Wisconsin).
.It Ic longitude
Decimal degrees, \-180 to 180, up to four decimals.
Default \-89.3841.
.It Ic name
The place's name for display: printable ASCII, up to 47 characters, no
.Ql # .
May be empty.
Default
.Ql Madison, WI .
.It Ic units
.Ql imperial
or
.Ql metric .
Default
.Ql imperial .
.It Ic timeout
Seconds to wait for each network step, 1 to 300.
Default 15.
Once connected, the rest of an attempt (handshake and answer) is limited to about three times this, so a server that trickles its answer is given up on.
.It Ic attempts
Tries per data source before giving up on it, 1 to 300.
Default 3.
.It Ic providers
Comma separated data sources in the order to try them:
.Ql open-meteo
and
.Ql met-no .
Default
.Ql open-meteo .
.It Ic contact
An e-mail address or web address that identifies you, sent in the User-Agent as
.Ql weather/VERSION (contact: ...) .
Printable ASCII, up to 79 characters, without
.Ql # ,
.Ql \&( 
or
.Ql \&) .
Required by the
.Ql met-no
source, whose terms of use ask every client to identify itself; that source is skipped while this is empty.
Default empty.
.It Ic log
Log level:
.Ql error ,
.Ql warn ,
.Ql info
or
.Ql debug .
Default
.Ql warn .
.It Ic autorefresh
.Ql on
or
.Ql off :
whether
.Xr xweather 1
refreshes by itself every 15 minutes.
Default
.Ql on .
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
# my weather
latitude  = 59.9100
longitude = 10.7500
name      = Oslo, Norway
units     = metric
autorefresh = on     # xweather only
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr weather 1 ,
.Xr xweather 1
